    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Spacious, bright and upgraded in 2020.  This two-bedroom apartment in the premium development of Carysfort Hall apartments is exceptionally large at 1047 sq.ft. / 97.30 sq.m.  With a large living room overlooking the manicured grounds of Carysfort Hall, the complex is on the edge of Carysfort Park, with a playground and lake within.\r\nUCD Smurfit Business School is located across the Park, while Blackrock Village is c. 1KM along Carysfort Avenue towards to the coast.  An abundance of amenities are all in the Village, including several coffee shops (Bear Market, Coffee to Go, Insomnia, Vanilla Pod), numerous restaurants throughout the Village including Michelin-Starred Liath in Blackrock Market. \r\nTransport is well-serviced in the area with several bus routes going north & southbound, DART station and easy proximity to N11 and M50 at J14 Leopardstown. Fully furnished."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE HALL\r\nWith new wooden flooring.  \r\n\r\nLOUNGE                                   C. 5.67M X 3.72M \r\nWith fireplace and feature bay window \r\noverlooking the manicured lawns of the \r\ncomplex.  New wooden flooring. \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DININGROOM   C. 4.32M X 5.76M\r\nDining area: new wooden flooring, stylish new dining suite and feature lighting.  Double French doors to patio terrace\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nKitchen area: modern fitted floor and wall units, integrated kitchen appliances including Neff hob, fridge, new freezer, new dishwasher, new Samsung oven and new microwave. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nUTILITY \t      C. 1.97M X  16.10M \r\nWith Viessman Vitoclens combi gas boiler, washing machine, separate condenser tumble dryer. Larder shelving. Tiled floor. \r\n\r\nBEDROOM NO. 1\t            C. 5.18M X 3.06M\r\nWith built-in wardrobe suite.  New carpet. Double Juliet window overlooking lawns of the complex.\r\nEN-SUITE \t             C. 2.65M X 1.75M \r\nWith bath & thermostatic shower, WHB, WC & Bidet.   Tiled walls & floor.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM NO. 2\t              C. 4.04M X 2.87M\r\nFitted double wardrobes. New carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nMAIN BATHROOM\t              C. 1.78M X 2.48M\r\nWith bath & thermostatic shower, WHB & WC.  Tiled floor and walls.\r\n\r\nSUN TERRACE            \t     C. 1.50M X 5.76M\r\nWith a south-facing aspect overlooking the front gardens, with terracotta tiling and private gate to the manicured front gardens."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Large 2-bedroom apartment of 1047 sq.ft./97.3 sq.m.\r\nCombi- gas boiler with instant hot water and Hive remote control\r\nWest-facing patio \r\nManicured gardens\r\nPrivate garage included\r\nParking\r\non edge of Carysfort Park\r\nc. 1KM from Blackrock Village, DART, amenities"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C3 BER No.113069140 Energy Performance Indicator:207 kWh/m²/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Travelling westbound up Carysfort Avenue, pass through traffic lights at On the Platter shop.  Continue along, passing Smurfit Business \r\nSchool.  Take next right turn into Carysfort Park.  Take first turn into Carysfort Hall."
      }
    ],
